Today is Saturday morning.
The month of March is very hot.
I am standing outside the apartment.
Anitha comes there.
"Good morning, Maya," Anitha says.
"Good morning, Anitha," I say.
"Today is very hot," I say.
I am wearing thick clothes.
"My clothes are very thick," I tell Anitha.
"I need cotton clothes in this heat."
"Wear thin cotton clothes," Anitha says.
"There is a big textile shop in the city."
"That is a good shop," she says.
"Good cotton clothes are available there."
"That's great," I say.
"I am going to that big shop today."
